Withdrawal of Russian troops from all over Ukraine, including Donbas and Crimea;
• Withdrawal of occupation forces on the line of 2014;
The withdrawal of the occupiers from Donbass, but not Crimea.

**Vladimir Zelensky rejected the last two options during a visit to Washington. **The Ukrainian president insists on the implementation of the first scenario.

