Trans:
How to get 6600 UAH from the UN in 2023?

**Application is made exclusively offline at the registration points (see [UT] addresses (https://kosht.media/dopomoha-dlia-vpo-iak-otrymaty-6600-hrn-vid-oon-u-2023-rotsi/)) with a full family, since assistance can be issued for all family members at the same time.

Bring the originals of the following documents for each person:

Tax number;
Passport or other identity documents;
IDP certificate (if available);
Bank card of the main applicant;
Certificate of birth of children (if necessary);
Document certifying legal custody of the child (if necessary);
Certificate / medical certificate in case of disability or chronic disease (if necessary).

If a person meets the criteria, then at least a month after submitting to a mobile phone, an SMS message will arrive.

A list of those who can get help can be found here - https://r2p.org.ua/rozshyreno-kryteriyi-lyudej-shho-mozhut-otrymaty-dopomogu-vid-uvkb-oon.

