Trans:
**The Ministry of Health of Ukraine publishes recommendations on how to use a generator to avoid danger to life**:

Generators and fuel must be used ** only outdoors at least 6 meters from windows,** doors and garages;
Keep the generator **dry, protect from rain and flooding.** Touching a wet generator or devices connected to it can lead to electric shock.
Before refueling, cool down the generator.** Fuel spilled on hot engine parts may flare up;
Install in the room ** carbon monoxide detectors;
**Be sure to purchase a fire extinguisher and keep it nearby in a visible and easily accessible place.

